{
  "qs": [
    {
      "id": "la_0040",
      "q": "Given $A = \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1\\\\1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$ and $B = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1\\\\-1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$, which statement correctly verifies that $B = A^{-1}$?",
      "t": ["0"],
      "c": [
        { "i": "a", "x": "$AB = I$ and $BA = I$, so $B = A^{-1}$" },
        { "i": "b", "x": "$AB = I$ only, so $B = A^{-1}$" },
        { "i": "c", "x": "$BA = I$ only, so $B = A^{-1}$" },
        { "i": "d", "x": "$A + B = I$, so $B = A^{-1}$" }
      ],
      "a": "a",
      "e": [
        "نحسب حاصل ضرب $AB$:",
        "$$AB = \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1\\\\1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1\\\\-1 & 2\\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix}2-1 & -2+2\\\\1-1 & -1+2\\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0\\\\0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} = I$$",
        "نحسب حاصل ضرب $BA$:",
        "$$BA = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1\\\\-1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1\\\\1 & 1\\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix}2-1 & 1-1\\\\-2+2 & -1+2\\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0\\\\0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} = I$$",
        "بما أن $AB = I$ و $BA = I$ معاً، فإن التعريف يُثبت أن $B = A^{-1}$.",
        "الإجابة الصحيحة: (a)"
      ],
      "ref": "Section 1.5"
    },
    {
      "id": "la_0041",
      "q": "Using the row reduction method, find $A^{-1}$ for $A = \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1\\\\1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$.",
      "t": ["0"],
      "c": [
        { "i": "a", "x": "$\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1\\\\-1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$" },
        { "i": "b", "x": "$\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1\\\\-1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$" },
        { "i": "c", "x": "$\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1\\\\1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$" },
        { "i": "d", "x": "$\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1\\\\-1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$" }
      ],
      "a": "a",
      "e": [
        "نُكوّن المصفوفة الموسّعة $[A \\mid I]$:",
        "$$\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|cc}2 & 1 & 1 & 0\\\\1 & 1 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]$$",
        "نطبّق عمليات الصف للوصول إلى الصورة المُختزلة (RREF):",
        "$R_1 \\leftrightarrow R_2$: $$\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|cc}1 & 1 & 0 & 1\\\\2 & 1 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]$$",
        "$R_2 \\leftarrow R_2 - 2R_1$: $$\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|cc}1 & 1 & 0 & 1\\\\0 & -1 & 1 & -2\\end{array}\\right]$$",
        "$R_2 \\leftarrow -R_2$: $$\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|cc}1 & 1 & 0 & 1\\\\0 & 1 & -1 & 2\\end{array}\\right]$$",
        "$R_1 \\leftarrow R_1 - R_2$: $$\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|cc}1 & 0 & 1 & -1\\\\0 & 1 & -1 & 2\\end{array}\\right]$$",
        "الجانب الأيسر أصبح $I$، إذاً: $$A^{-1} = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1\\\\-1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$$"
      ],
      "ref": "Section 1.5"
    },
    {
      "id": "la_0042",
      "q": "Attempt to find the inverse of $A = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2\\\\2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$ using row reduction. What is the conclusion?",
