    {
      "id": "la_0054",
      "q": "Given $A = \\begin{bmatrix}3 & 5\\\\1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$ and $B = \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1\\\\1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$, compute $(AB)^{-1}$ and verify that $(AB)^{-1} = B^{-1}A^{-1}$.",
