      "q": "Given that $A = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2\\\\1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$ and $B = \\begin{bmatrix}3 & 7\\\\2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$, find $(AB)^{-1} = B^{-1}A^{-1}$.",
